# An allowlist: the build context holds only what the image needs, so a new secret or
# scratch file never reaches the builder by default. (infra/minio has its own context.)
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src
!migrations
!scenarios
!web
# ScriptedModel's cassettes (CASSETTE_DIR's default): MODEL_MODE=scripted, the hosted
# default, plays them. Nothing else under tests/ enters the image.
!tests/fixtures/cassettes

# Never in the context, even inside an allowed directory.
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
web/dist
web/coverage
